{"id":"vod_zy360_71271","vodId":"71271","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"鸭乃桥论的禁忌推理 第二季","name_cn":"鸭乃桥论的禁忌推理 第二季","date":"2024-01-01","year":"2024","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至03集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20250202-1/60b2f997794b27fa7e19558815803ef2.jpg"},"summary":"在世界顶尖侦探学校·青蓝被誉为天才的鸭乃桥论，因患上某个致命“缺陷”，被剥夺了成为侦探的资格。在度过一段怀才不遇的岁月后，与警视厅搜查一课的一色都都丸——外号“都都”的相遇，极大改变了他的命运。论负责解谜，都都负责侦查，他们接连侦破疑难案件，逐渐成为了名搭档。青蓝内部也有论的理解者在两眼发光地关注着他的动向。其中一人就是校长艾梅利希。她告诉论，导致他被开除的“染血实习案”是一个圈套。其幕后主使，是制造了众多悬案的“史上最凶恶的犯罪一族”——M家，家主名叫麦罗·莫里亚蒂。为了给予论更大的绝望，麦罗将妹妹·温特派往了日本。论与麦罗之间究竟有何恩怨？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动画,悬疑,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-02-08 21:02:23","episodeCount":13,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250202/IlmvKWAi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250205/1IThzo11/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250207/kHQAsJE3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/9D8A36nR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/HDQJOB25/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/CtxuSXCX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/cPLrkYQg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/XyuPQDyd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/DqhfP0fN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/uSoErhK6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/hHGeaHRp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/wgiKbmgw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250208/b47J2TBf/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:20.776Z"}